# A STATIC COMMITTED FIXTURE (EP-28W W2). It is NEVER the live board of record.
#
# It exists so that rows asserting "the positive control runs at EVERY invocation" can
# drive `board.main()` through a real file path WITHOUT reading
# planning/build/BOARD-EVENTS.log. Those rows previously used main()'s DEFAULT path, which
# is the live record — so a lawful edit to the record reported as a code failure. The
# ruling took four rows out of the suite; two more reached the same file through a default
# rather than through a name, and a check phrased over "a reference to the path" could not
# see them.
#
# The extension is deliberately NOT `.log`: the repository's .gitignore matches `*.log`,
# so a fixture named that way would be untracked and absent from a fresh clone while the
# suite that needs it stayed green here.
# ==================== SEED BLOCK ====================
